<p><b>2. 第三方服务依赖：</b>本软件内置的"免费模型"功能，依赖第三方服务商（如 OpenKilo、OpenCode Zen 等）提供的 API 接口。用户与 AI 的对话内容将被传输至用户所选的第三方服务器，开发者无法控制这些服务的数据处理行为，建议用户谨慎输入个人隐私信息。<br/><i>Dependence on third-party services: The built-in "free model" feature relies on API interfaces provided by third-party providers (such as OpenKilo, OpenCode Zen, etc.). Your conversation content will be transmitted to the third-party servers you select. The developer has no control over how these services process data, so please be cautious when entering personal or private information.</i></p>
<p><b>3. 内容风险：</b>AI 生成的内容可能包含错误、偏见或不适宜信息，不代表开发者观点。用户需对使用 AI 产生的任何后果自行承担责任。<br/><i>Content risk: AI-generated content may contain errors, biases, or inappropriate information and does not represent the developer\'s views. Users are solely responsible for any consequences arising from their use of AI.</i></p>
<p><b>4. 服务稳定性：</b>免费 API 由第三方提供，不保证 7x24 小时可用，随时可能因上游政策调整而中断或限流。<br/><i>Service stability: Free APIs are provided by third parties. Availability is not guaranteed 24/7, and the service may be interrupted or rate-limited at any time due to upstream policy changes.</i></p>
<p><b>5. 声明更新：</b>开发者保留更新本免责声明的权利，更新后的版本将在应用内展示。<br/><i>Declaration updates: The developer reserves the right to update this disclaimer, and the updated version will be displayed within the application.</i></p>
<p><b>本声明最后更新：2026-07-31</b><br/><i>Last updated: 2026-07-31</i></p>
]]></string>

